#: ../../api/palm_tracer.UI.NotificationWidget.rst:2
msgid "NotificationWidget"
msgstr ""

#: of palm_tracer.UI.NotificationWidget.NotificationWidget:1
msgid "Affiche un message superposé dans le coin inférieur droit de son parent, sans prendre le focus."
msgstr "Displays an overlay message in the lower-right corner of its parent without taking focus."

#: of palm_tracer.UI.NotificationWidget.NotificationWidget:3
msgid "Une seule instance est réutilisée : chaque nouveau message remplace le précédent et réinitialise son délai et son opacité. La notification ne fait partie d'aucun layout et ne change donc pas la disposition des commandes. Toutes ses méthodes doivent être appelées depuis le thread graphique."
msgstr "A single instance is reused: each new message replaces the previous one and resets its delay and opacity. The notification is not part of a layout and therefore does not change the arrangement of controls. All its methods must be called from the GUI thread."

#: ../../api/palm_tracer.UI.NotificationWidget.rst
msgid "Paramètres"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: of palm_tracer.UI.NotificationWidget.NotificationWidget:7
msgid "Panneau ou fenêtre délimitant la notification."
msgstr "Panel or window defining the notification boundaries."

#: ../../api/palm_tracer.UI.NotificationWidget.rst:9
msgid "Attributs"
msgstr "Attributes"

#: of palm_tracer.UI.NotificationWidget.NotificationWidget.MAXIMUM_WIDTH:1
msgid "Largeur maximale de la notification, en pixels logiques."
msgstr "Maximum notification width, in logical pixels."

#: of palm_tracer.UI.NotificationWidget.NotificationWidget.MARGIN:1
msgid "Distance souhaitée aux bords du parent, en pixels logiques."
msgstr "Desired distance from the parent edges, in logical pixels."

#: of palm_tracer.UI.NotificationWidget.NotificationWidget.FADE_DURATION:1
msgid "Durée du fondu de fermeture, en millisecondes."
msgstr "Dismissal fade duration, in milliseconds."

#: ../../api/palm_tracer.UI.NotificationWidget.rst:16
msgid "Méthodes"
msgstr "Methods"

#: ../../api/palm_tracer.UI.NotificationWidget.rst:19
msgid "Affichage"
msgstr "Display"

#: of palm_tracer.UI.NotificationWidget.NotificationWidget.show_message:1
msgid "Remplace le message courant et programme son fondu après le délai demandé."
msgstr "Replaces the current message and schedules its fade after the requested delay."

#: of palm_tracer.UI.NotificationWidget.NotificationWidget.show_message:3
msgid "Texte brut à afficher ; il n'est jamais interprété comme du HTML."
msgstr "Plain text to display; it is never interpreted as HTML."

#: of palm_tracer.UI.NotificationWidget.NotificationWidget.show_message:4
msgid "Niveau déterminant l'icône et la couleur de la bordure."
msgstr "Level determining the icon and border color."

#: of palm_tracer.UI.NotificationWidget.NotificationWidget.show_message:5
msgid "Délai avant fondu en millisecondes ; zéro conserve le message jusqu'à sa fermeture manuelle."
msgstr "Delay before fading, in milliseconds; zero keeps the message until it is dismissed manually."

#: ../../api/palm_tracer.UI.NotificationWidget.rst
msgid "Lève"
msgstr "Raises"

#: of palm_tracer.UI.NotificationWidget.NotificationWidget.show_message:6
msgid "Si le niveau est inconnu ou le délai négatif."
msgstr "If the level is unknown or the delay is negative."

#: of palm_tracer.UI.NotificationWidget.NotificationWidget.reposition:1
msgid "Ajuste la taille au parent et replace la notification sans modifier les layouts environnants."
msgstr "Adjusts the size to the parent and repositions the notification without changing the surrounding layouts."

#: of palm_tracer.UI.NotificationWidget.NotificationWidget.dismiss:1
msgid "Ferme immédiatement la notification et annule toute temporisation ou animation en cours."
msgstr "Immediately dismisses the notification and cancels any active timer or animation."
